<header>
  <h1>Zayah Workshop</h1>
  <p>Creative Digital Solutions & Tech Services</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#about">About</a>
  <a href="#services">Services</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">
  <h2>Welcome</h2>
  <p>Welcome to Zayah Workshop, your all-in-one hub for digital creativity and mobile solutions. We provide video editing, graphic design, photo editing, phone repair, and premium subscriptions.</p>
  <a href="#contact" class="btn">Message Us</a>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About Us</h2>
  <p>Zayah Workshop is dedicated to delivering affordable, reliable, and high-quality services. We help students, creators, and businesses bring their ideas to life through creativity and technology.</p>
</section>

<section id="services">
